# Optional overrides when running: dotnet run --project AIDR.Api
# Prefer: dotnet user-secrets (does not load this file automatically).

# Gmail App Password example (set via user-secrets, not committed):
# Smtp__Enabled=true
# Smtp__Host=smtp.gmail.com
# Smtp__Port=587
# Smtp__EnableSsl=true
# Smtp__Username=your.email@gmail.com
# Smtp__Password=your-app-password
# Smtp__From=your.email@gmail.com
# Smtp__FromDisplayName=AIDR

# payOS sandbox (set UseMock=false when credentials are present):
# PayOS__ClientId=
# PayOS__ApiKey=
# PayOS__ChecksumKey=
# PayOS__UseMock=false
# PayOS__ReturnUrl=http://localhost:5173/order-received
# PayOS__CancelUrl=http://localhost:5173/order-received?cancelled=1

# Groq (https://console.groq.com/keys) - prefer user-secrets, do not commit real keys:
# Groq__BaseUrl=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# Groq__ApiKey=gsk_your_key_here
# Groq__Model=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# Groq__UseMock=false
# Groq__TimeoutSeconds=60
